    "Name: Jade
Gender: Female
Race: Deadbeat

A young mercenary only known as Jade. Not much information about her past is verifiable other than the fact she was found in the middle of a scorched desert, far from her people. A crew of Penguins saved her from certain doom and, unsure where she came from, decided to adopt her. She was then taken offworld and trained in both short- and long-range combat.",

"The mercenary unit Jade became part of was eventually employed by the Relic Seekers to escort their cargo space trains. The unit's current tasks also involve shipping and personnel protection.

While Jade is not officially a Relic Seeker, at times displaying a lack of subordination, her skills are particularly helpful during artifact recovery missions. Her combat experience also provides extra security aboard the ST Syllectis."

